### 템플릿 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 템플릿 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "주간 회의",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "placeholder": "내용을 적어 주세요",
      "required": false
    }
  ]
}

### 템플릿 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 템플릿 이름 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork"
}

### 템플릿 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 템플릿 활성화
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 섹션 추가
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "주간 회의",
  "type": "TEXT",
  "placeholder": "내용을 적어 주세요",
  "required": false
}

### 섹션 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1/sections/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "주간 회의",
  "placeholder": "내용을 적어 주세요"
}

### 섹션 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-note-templates/1/sections/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
